y to the people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b003:l039","ordinal":277448,"en":"There is a bruise on the forehead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l001","ordinal":277449,"en":"There's a lot to take in."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l002","ordinal":277450,"en":"Do not let dust rise from the ground,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l003","ordinal":277451,"en":"Not even from India."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l004","ordinal":277452,"en":"All the earth will be sound,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l005","ordinal":277453,"en":"Saying that Er Semetei is dead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l006","ordinal":277454,"en":"There will be noise in the crowd,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l007","ordinal":277455,"en":"People will be running."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l008","ordinal":277456,"en":"Let the village stay green"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l009","ordinal":277457,"en":"If the enemy comes, let him throw a spear,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l010","ordinal":277458,"en":"If the hero comes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l011","ordinal":277459,"en":"Let them face each other."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l012","ordinal":277460,"en":"Your hero is alive"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l013","ordinal":277461,"en":"Let them fight"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l014","ordinal":277462,"en":"Let them be brave."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l015","ordinal":277463,"en":"A lot of enemies"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l016","ordinal":277464,"en":"Don't look back"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l017","ordinal":277465,"en":"Many Kyrgyz, many people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l018","ordinal":277466,"en":"Enemy came in"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l019","ordinal":277467,"en":"Do not measure the whip,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l020","ordinal":277468,"en":"Don't let lions die,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l021","ordinal":277469,"en":"Don't let your partner die!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l022","ordinal":277470,"en":"This is Talas Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l023","ordinal":277471,"en":"Don't let the cold-hearted enemy come."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l024","ordinal":277472,"en":"This is what I said to my people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l025","ordinal":277473,"en":"Come on Kulchoro!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l026","ordinal":277474,"en":"Tell the crowd my sadness,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l027","ordinal":277475,"en":"I have ninety horses in the mountains"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l028","ordinal":277476,"en":"There is a lot of steam inside,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l029","ordinal":277477,"en":"Say hello to the crowd!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l030","ordinal":277478,"en":"Let him collect without leaving,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l031","ordinal":277479,"en":"All the sheep"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l032","ordinal":277480,"en":"Let it be crushed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l033","ordinal":277481,"en":"Black wins"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l034","ordinal":277482,"en":"Choose a donkey and ride,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l035","ordinal":277483,"en":"Face to face for everyone"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l036","ordinal":277484,"en":"Let Karalchu walk like a nail."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l037","ordinal":277485,"en":"Blood for the rest"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l038","ordinal":277486,"en":"To all the rest of the people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1192:b004:l039","ordinal":277487,"en":"Let him live again."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l001","ordinal":277488,"en":"When blood dies, everything dies."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l002","ordinal":277489,"en":"People are running and shouting,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l003","ordinal":277490,"en":"Let him not put courage"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l004","ordinal":277491,"en":"There were many invisible enemies,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l005","ordinal":277492,"en":"There was no burying enemy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l006","ordinal":277493,"en":"Do not overwhelm the population,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l007","ordinal":277494,"en":"Do not let the population reach the bottom,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l008","ordinal":277495,"en":"Just be careful!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l009","ordinal":277496,"en":"Do not spoil the army,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l010","ordinal":277497,"en":"Do not cause trouble to the population."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l011","ordinal":277498,"en":"Let the people listen to me"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l012","ordinal":277499,"en":"If your eyes are closed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l013","ordinal":277500,"en":"Kaglayin Kulchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l014","ordinal":277501,"en":"Find your good people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l015","ordinal":277502,"en":"Look at your Kyrgyz people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l016","ordinal":277503,"en":"Wait for your Sultan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1193:b003:l017","ordinal":277504,"en":"Argyn and Kyrgyz"}]
